# Edge of the length rules (#724): a parameter of 1005 characters; Epic
# refuses a field and a local of 1005 (3655) and admits 1004. OpenVerse
# takes the same limit for a parameter and refuses it. If Epic admits it, it
# prints
#   result 42
# Run it alone (single mode).
# Epic's compiler (UEFN 43.12, ++Fortnite+Release-43.12-CL-60598086,
# BuildAll, 2026-11-19) admits it (compiled only). OpenVerse admits it now.
F(:int):int = 

Main():void =
    Print("OVPROBE result {F(42)}")
